{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../bearer_auth/", "title": "Bearer Auth"}, "next": {"link": "../client_assertion/", "title": "Client Assertion"}, "title": "Dpop Auth", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth_schemes.dpop_auth\">\n<span id=\"dpop-auth\"></span><h1>Dpop Auth<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth_schemes.dpop_auth\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth\" title=\"auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DPoPAuth</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Base class for all authentication schemes.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"functions\">\n<h2>Functions<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#functions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.make_dpop_proof_for_token_endpoint\" title=\"auth_schemes.dpop_auth.make_dpop_proof_for_token_endpoint\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">make_dpop_proof_for_token_endpoint</span></code></a>(\u2192 str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Build a DPoP proof JWT for use at the token endpoint (RFC 9449 \u00a74.2).</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_schemes.dpop_auth.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DPoPAuth</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">httpx.Auth</span></code></p>\n<p>Base class for all authentication schemes.</p>\n<p>To implement a custom authentication scheme, subclass <cite>Auth</cite> and override\nthe <cite>.auth_flow()</cite> method.</p>\n<p>If the authentication scheme does I/O such as disk access or network calls, or uses\nsynchronization primitives such as locks, you should override <cite>.sync_auth_flow()</cite>\nand/or <cite>.async_auth_flow()</cite> instead of <cite>.auth_flow()</cite> to provide specialized\nimplementations that will be used by <cite>Client</cite> and <cite>AsyncClient</cite> respectively.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth.auth_flow\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_flow</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">request</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">httpx.Request</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth.auth_flow\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Execute the authentication flow.</p>\n<p>To dispatch a request, <cite>yield</cite> it:</p>\n<p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">`</span>\n<span class=\"pre\">yield</span> <span class=\"pre\">request</span>\n<span class=\"pre\">`</span></code></p>\n<p>The client will <cite>.send()</cite> the response back into the flow generator. You can\naccess it like so:</p>\n<p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">`</span>\n<span class=\"pre\">response</span> <span class=\"pre\">=</span> <span class=\"pre\">yield</span> <span class=\"pre\">request</span>\n<span class=\"pre\">`</span></code></p>\n<p>A <cite>return</cite> (or reaching the end of the generator) will result in the\nclient returning the last response obtained from the server.</p>\n<p>You can dispatch as many requests as is necessary.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth.requires_request_body\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">requires_request_body</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">True</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth.requires_request_body\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_schemes.dpop_auth.make_dpop_proof_for_token_endpoint\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_schemes.dpop_auth.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">make_dpop_proof_for_token_endpoint</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">method</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">url</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">nonce</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.make_dpop_proof_for_token_endpoint\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Build a DPoP proof JWT for use at the token endpoint (RFC 9449 \u00a74.2).\nUnlike resource-server proofs, token-endpoint proofs do NOT include <cite>ath</cite>\nbecause no access token exists yet at issuance time.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth_schemes/client_assertion/index", "Client Assertion", "N", "next"], ["reference/auth_schemes/bearer_auth/index", "Bearer Auth", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/auth_schemes/dpop_auth/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Dpop Auth</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#classes\">Classes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#functions\">Functions</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DPoPAuth</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth.auth_flow\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DPoPAuth.auth_flow()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.DPoPAuth.requires_request_body\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DPoPAuth.requires_request_body</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.dpop_auth.make_dpop_proof_for_token_endpoint\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">make_dpop_proof_for_token_endpoint()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "reference/auth_schemes/dpop_auth/index", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/ethical-ads.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html", "sidebar/variant-selector.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#f2f2f2", "foreground": "#1e1e1e"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}